Town of Portola Valley Autonomy Measure. Shall the
measure maintaining Portola Valley’s independent status
be adopted, providing: wildfire prevention/vegetation
management; 911 emergency response/police patrols; local
zoning/planning services; storm drain repair; and general
government services; by adopting a charter for the Town of
Portola Valley solely for, and establishing a real property
transfer tax of $10 per $1,000, paid by buyers or sellers of
property, until ended by voters, providing approximately
$2,000,000 in locally controlled funding annually, with
independent oversight?